# The `web` image builds with the repo root as its context (it needs both
# landing/ and app/), so keep the heavy and the sensitive out of the upload.
# Note this file does NOT apply to the `api` service — that one builds with
# ./api as its context and would need its own api/.dockerignore.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
api/target
Brainstorming
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
